[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0550","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0550.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-32073","title":"Microsoft Windows WinSock 辅助功能驱动程序特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows Ancillary Function Driver for WinSock（afd.sys）存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。已获得低权限的本地攻击者可通过特制的系统调用触发 afd.sys 对已释放内存对象的访问，导致权限提升至 SYSTEM 级别。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高，需要攻击者具备本地登录权限，影响多个 Windows 版本。Microsoft 尚未发布官方补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-32073"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-04-14T18:17:08Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:35:04Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2026 年 4 月安全更新，各受影响版本对应修复版本号：Windows 10 1607 ≥ 10.0.14393.9060、Windows 10 1809 ≥ 10.0.17763.8644、Windows 10 21H2 ≥ 10.0.19044.7184、Windows 10 22H2 ≥ 10.0.19045.7184、Windows 11 23H2 ≥ 10.0.22631.6936、Windows 11 24H2 ≥ 10.0.26100.8246、Windows 11 25H2 ≥ 10.0.26200.8246、Windows 11 26H1 ≥ 10.0.28000.1836。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft 更新目录网站手动下载安装。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制本地用户登录权限，并监控 afd.sys 异常调用行为作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-32073","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2026/32xxx/CVE-2026-32073.json","https://github.com/ghostbyt3/nday-automation-ai/blob/d2596d168953cf19973b1691c14f7907dc5af8a3/nday_research_reports/2026-Apr/CVE-2026-32073_afd.sys_analysis.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-32073.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2026-32073","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2026/32xxx/CVE-2026-32073.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-32073.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2026/04/GHSA-44pc-wvm3-296c/GHSA-44pc-wvm3-296c.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2026-32073","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-32073.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/08ea89e8807d0d5cf7150243c834721985237c9e/CVEs_log/2026-04-15_zh.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0550.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0534","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0534.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-26179","title":"Microsoft Windows Kernel 双释放本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows 内核（Secure Kernel）中存在双重释放（Double Free）漏洞（CWE-415），已获得授权的本地攻击者可通过向受影响的 Windows 系统发送特制的系统调用，触发内核对象的内存双重释放，进而实现权限提升至 SYSTEM 级别。该漏洞影响 Windows 内核的虚拟安全模式（VSM）组件，攻击者需具备本地登录权限方可利用。CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。微软尚未发布官方安全更新，但已有公开 PoC 代码可供参考。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-26179"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-04-14T18:16:54Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:25:53Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2026 年 4 月安全更新（对应 CVE-2026-26179 的 Windows Secure Kernel 修复补丁），可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载。该漏洞位于 Windows Secure Kernel (VTL1) 中，攻击者需已在目标系统上获得高权限代码执行能力方可利用。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制本地高权限用户的登录范围，并启用 Credential Guard 和 Device Guard 等基于虚拟化的安全功能作为深度防御措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-26179","https://github.com/nikosecurity/CVE-2026-26179","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f015220eb1b2405b0fcce99fab82aef08d37a0ce/2026/CVE-2026-26179.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-26179.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2026/26xxx/CVE-2026-26179.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad