响GIMP的多个版本，攻击者需诱导用户打开恶意ANI文件或访问包含恶意内容的网页才能成功利用。CVSS评分为7.8，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-4151"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-04-11T01:16:16Z","updated":"2026-07-15T02:22:38Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 GIMP 至 3.2.4 或更高版本，该版本已修复 ANI 文件解析过程中的整数溢出漏洞。用户应避免打开来源不明的 ANI 动画光标文件，直到完成软件升级。组织管理员可通过软件分发系统批量推送安全更新，或临时禁用 ANI 文件导入功能作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gimp/-/commit/09e5459de913172fc51da3bd6b6adc533acd368e","https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-26-218/","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:16484","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:19362","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-4151","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2457532","https://security.access.redhat.com/data/csaf/v2/vex/2026/cve-2026-4151.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2026/4xxx/CVE-2026-4151.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5e01c1166494caecdbc667191fbe09790056cc38/2026/4xxx/CVE-2026-4151.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2026/CVE-2026-41517.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2026/CVE-2026-41512.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2026/CVE-2026-41511.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2026/CVE-2026-41518.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2026/CVE-2026-41513.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97ee81b7fd22aa607f2e870c57709c6d893c5430/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-4151.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97ee81b7fd22aa607f2e870c57709c6d893c5430/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-4151.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-4151.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1007.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1005","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1005.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-4150","title":"GIMP PSD文件解析整数溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"GIMP 在处理特制 PSD 文件时存在整数溢出漏洞。由于解析 PSD 文件过程中对用户提供的数据缺乏足够的边界验证，攻击者可触发整数溢出并在缓冲区分配前造成内存损坏，进而在当前进程上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响安装了受影响版本 GIMP 的系统，攻击者需要诱使目标用户打开恶意 PSD 文件或访问包含恶意文件的网页才能成功利用。CVSS v3.1 评分为 7.8，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-4150"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-04-11T01:16:16Z","updated":"2026-07-15T02:22:38Z","remediation":"建议将 GIMP 升级至 2.8.22-1 或更高版本，以修复 PSD 文件解析中的整数溢出漏洞。Amazon Linux 2 用户可执行 `sudo yum update --advisories ALAS2GIMP-2026-014 gimp` 应用官方安全补丁；Ubuntu/Debian 用户可执行 `sudo apt-get update && sudo apt-get install --only-upgrade gimp`。如暂时无法升级，应避免打开来源不明的 PSD 文件，并在系统防火墙或邮件网关中拦截 .psd 附件下载，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gimp/-/commit/00afdabdadeb5457fd897878b1e5aebc3780af10","https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-26-217/","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:16484","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:17533","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:19362","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:20552","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:20553","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:20554","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:20691","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:25899","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:25901","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:25907","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:26168","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-4150","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2457535","https://security.access.redhat.com/data/csaf/v2/vex/2026/cve-2026-4150.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cve