token 手动配置。补丁提交为 8f3310000a8b0c11eced054c2cdb6fb27803511a。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/security/advisories/GHSA-6g25-pc82-vfwp","https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-26-229/","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/536340d55f91e2a0c09223b3194e9dd68ac48811/data/vuln/openclaw/CVE-2026-3691.yaml","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/536340d55f91e2a0c09223b3194e9dd68ac48811/data/vuln_en/openclaw/CVE-2026-3691.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2026/3xxx/CVE-2026-3691.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2026/CVE-2026-36910.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-3691.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-3691.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-3691.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-36xx/CVE-2026-3691.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b4c640370a6a34ea36c82cbaea3c29d7c103902a/content/posts/cve-2026-3691.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/f785f3444159263c9afde232b5456d1f01686673/api/2026/CVE-2026-3691.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0976.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0974","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0974.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-3690","title":"OpenClaw Canvas 身份验证绕过漏洞","description":"OpenClaw 的 Canvas 端点认证功能存在身份验证绕过漏洞。该漏洞源于认证机制实现不当，未经身份认证的远程攻击者无需任何凭证即可利用此漏洞，通过向目标系统发送特制的请求绕过 Canvas 端点的身份验证检查，从而获取对系统的未授权访问权限，导致机密性和完整性受到高等级影响。该漏洞影响 OpenClaw 相关版本，CVSS 评分 7.4，危害等级高。目前厂商已发布安全公告 GHSA-vvjh-f6p9-5vcf 提供修复方案。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-3690"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-04-11T01:16:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:44:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 OpenClaw 至 2026.2.19 或更高版本（commit c45f3c5b），该版本修复了 `authorizeCanvasRequest()` 中基于 IP 的认证绕过逻辑。如无法升级，在网关配置中将 `--bind lan` 改为 `--bind loopback` 仅监听本地回环地址，或通过反向代理（如 Nginx）在网关前增加独立 token 校验层，禁止从共享 IP 环境（NAT/K8s/Docker）直接暴露 canvas 端点（`/__openclaw__/a2ui/`、`/__openclaw__/canvas/`、`/__openclaw__/ws`）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/security/advisories/GHSA-vvjh-f6p9-5vcf","https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-26-228/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2026/CVE-2026-3690.md","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/536340d55f91e2a0c09223b3194e9dd68ac48811/data/vuln/openclaw/CVE-2026-3690.yaml","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/536340d55f91e2a0c09223b3194e9dd68ac48811/data/vuln_en/openclaw/CVE-2026-3690.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2026/3xxx/CVE-2026-3690.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4683223ae150496144b181156e51d2b32e6b15f8/2026/3xxx/CVE-2026-3690.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2026/CVE-2026-36908.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-3690.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-3690.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/5f5abbd8608de32353d4b1190991d6df75c2631f/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-3690.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-3690.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0974.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0974.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0974.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0972","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0972.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-3689","title":"OpenClaw Canvas 路径穿越信息泄露漏洞","description":"OpenClaw 的 Canvas 网关端点存在路径遍历漏洞，由于在处理用户提供的路径参数时缺乏充分的验证，导致攻击者可在文件操作中使用恶意构造的路径。经过身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响版本的 OpenClaw 发送特制的请求，利用该漏洞读取服务账户权限下的任意文件，造成敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 OpenClaw 2026.2.21 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-3689"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-04-11T01:16:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:44:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 OpenClaw 至 2026.2.21 或更高版本（commit 39816e6），该版本已在 canvas 工具的 a2ui_push 处理器中对 jsonlPath 参数添加了路径规范化与目录白名单校验。如无法立即升级，可在网关前置反向代理（如 Nginx）中配置规则，拦截对 /tools/invoke 接口中 jsonlPath 参数包含 ../ 或绝对路径的请求，同时限制网关进程的文件系统访问权限（如使用容器只读文件系统或 seccomp 策略）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/security/advisories/GHSA-jq4x-98m3-ggq6","https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-26-227/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2026/CVE-2026-3689.md","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/536340d55f91e2a0c09223b3194e9dd68ac48811/data/vuln/openclaw/CVE-2026-3689.yaml","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/536340d55f91e2a0c09223b3194e9dd68ac48811/data/vuln_en/openclaw/CVE-2026-3689.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2026/3xxx/CVE-2026-3689.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1d36f3e9bfc6430c5bcee0e6bd4df5788a4946f1/2026/3xxx/CVE-2026-3689.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-3689.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2026/